      ],
      "importance": 2,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C02-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Hey, Dr. Saltzman, uh, can we talk?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C02-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "Yeah, of course. I was just doing some Phoenix research. Please sit down."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C02-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Um, yeah, well, I mean, obviously I'm dying to know m-more, uh, pard-pardon the pun. Uh, but actually, I wanted to talk to you about..."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C02-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "MG? Is he still acting weird? Look, once Emma's done with her therapy intensive with Raf, she'll work with MG... And she'll work with you, too, if you want to deal with the fallout of him, you know... killing you."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C02-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Dr. Saltzman, I'm honestly just glad to know what I am. And that I belong at the school."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C02-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "Good. You, uh... got a little..."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C02-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Yeah, that was actually what I wanted to talk to you about."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C02-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "Paint?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C02-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "Hope."
          }
          
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C02-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Yeah, that was actually what I wanted to talk to you about."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C02-T08",
