              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I'm so sorry, I was totally insensitive, and I just, I..."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C07-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Where did this statue come from?"
