        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C08-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "MG",
              "version": "MG"
            },
            "text": "Who would do this to my mom?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C08-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Well, not just who would... Who could?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C08-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "It could be a bad spell translation, a potion mishap?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C08-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Or a monster."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C08-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "There's no reason a monster would be here."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C08-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Lizzie",
              "version": "Lizzie"
            },
            "text": "Unless this sentient jar of artisanal mayonnaise activated a new artifact. What did you touch?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C08-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Everything. We cleaned the school from top to bottom, remember? But if we're just gonna throw out wild theories, here's one: what if the person who did this showed up today, out of nowhere, acting all buddy-buddy, manipulating romantic feelings to get someone's guard down?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C08-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Do you seriously suspect Roman?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C08-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Yeah, we all should. The timing is too convenient."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C08-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I thought you were sorry for acting jealous."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C08-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I was sorry, but now I'm vindicated."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C08-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "All right, Lizzie, Hope, you keep an eye on the contestants. MG, we're gonna search the campus. Landon..."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C08-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I'm gonna go ask Roman some questions."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C08-T14",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Yeah, super helpful. Ask a vampire how he turned a woman to stone."
          }
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C08-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Do you seriously suspect Roman?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E14-C08-T09",
